#==== Store Listing ====

@store_listing

You pick an element on the page and change it from the editor: font, colour, margins, visibility and a lot more. You can also write your own CSS.

★ Easy to use: pick and style elements without writing code
★ Simple and quick: changes are saved instantly
★ Code editor: write your own CSS
★ Readability: make articles on any site easy to read by hiding sidebars, footers and ads
★ Greyscale: turn it on to reduce eye strain while browsing

@privacy_policy

Privacy Policy:

Stylebot has never collected and will never collect any personal data, browsing history or the like. It asks for access to websites only so you can customise the CSS of any page, and so your CSS is applied automatically when you visit that page again.

In the future, Stylebot may collect the browser version, platform name and user settings (never the list of websites or any other data that could identify you). This would help decide which new features to build, which unused features to remove, and which default settings to suggest to new users. It will only happen with your permission.

